I notice the other overload below has some differences. It *adds* the distance above terrain, but you *subtract* here. The other overload also doesn't account for layers. I feel like that other overload has some bugs!

Maybe have the other overload call into this one, so they both benefit from the fix:
```c#
public void SetPosition(Actor self, WPos pos)
{
	var cell = self.World.Map.CellContaining(pos);
	SetPosition(self, cell);
}
```
